<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ROSENBORG BEAT AC MILAN 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROSENBORG BEAT AC MILAN 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN, Italy 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rosenborg beat AC Milan 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in their European Cup Champions' League group D</p>
<p>match on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Christophe Dugarry, 45</p>
<p>Rosenborg - Harald Brattbakk 29, Vegard Heggem 69</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,000</p>
